    "body": "@jsnajdr thank you! You need to make your membership of that organization public so the bot can see it. See https://docs.github.com/en/account-and-profile/setting-up-and-managing-your-personal-account-on-github/managing-your-membership-in-organizations/publicizing-or-hiding-organization-membership for instructions. Good to have some representation from WordPress!\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nIt's more that style sheets can delay scripts I think, that would end up causing delays: search for \"contributes a script-blocking style sheet\".",
